row @17,645,694,568
  link "Voting and elections Find out how to register to vote, where your voting location is, how presidential elections work, and more about voting in the United States." /voting-and-elections @17,655,29,548
  link "The U.S. and its government Learn about U.S. laws, history, and more. Buy government property. Contact elected officials and federal agencies." /about-the-us @58,716,27,426
  link "Complaints File complaints involving government agencies, telemarketers, products and services, travel, housing, and banking." /complaints @97,787,23,284
  link "Disability services Find government benefits and programs for people with disabilities and their families." /disability-services @132,787,19,284
  link "Disasters and emergencies Learn about disaster assistance and find government benefits for other emergencies." /disasters-and-emergencies @163,787,21,284
  link "Education Learn about Federal Student Aid and studying in the U.S. Find early intervention, special education, and Head Start programs." /education @196,726,25,406
  link "Government benefits Find government programs that may help pay for food, housing, health care, and more." /benefits @233,767,20,324
  link "Health Get information about health insurance. Find help for mental health and other medical conditions, testing, and paying medical bills." /health @265,726,26,406
  link "Housing help Learn about rental and buyer assistance programs. Find emergency housing and avoid eviction." /housing-help @303,777,20,304
  link "Immigration and U.S. citizenship Learn about U.S. residency, Green Cards, citizenship requirements, and related issues." /immigration-and-citizenship @335,777,22,304
  link "Innovation Find ways you can participate through citizen science projects and challenges. Explore active competitions and volunteer opportunities. Innovation is essential to solving problems." /innovation @369,685,35,488
